  "reading_policy": [
    "p86 A retains MG08, the OSMAN address/office fields and all reference numerals; the numeral 4 within BER4ICH is separately preserved and repaired as a word error, without changing the square.",
    "p104 C1 has 227 real slots against the printed 228. The visibly short GAGA group motivates a one-missing-coordinate model. All 228 retrospective insertion positions are priced; three equal-A placements produce the same complete 228-coordinate witness. Only 168/169 are within or at the visible group boundary.",
    "p104 C retains the unresolved DTSCHXSTAAT field, MARSH spelling and both RETTERL/KETTERL name tokens. They are not silently regularized."
  ],
